  <steps>
    <step order="1">Declare IMemoListProps { memos: Memo[]; currentMemoId: string | null; onSelect: (id: string) =&gt; void; }</step>
    <step order="2">Implement as a Fluent v9 Menu triggered by a list icon button. Each MenuItem shows deriveTitle(memo.sprk_body) + createdon date (Intl.DateTimeFormat locale).</step>
    <step order="3">Highlight the currentMemoId row (colorNeutralBackground3 or similar).</step>
    <step order="4">Add unit tests: renders one MenuItem per memo; onSelect fires with correct id; empty list renders "No memos yet" state.</step>
    <step order="5">Run tests.</step>
    <step order="6">Update TASK-INDEX.md: mark 034 ✅.</step>
    <step order="7">Document deviations in notes/.</step>
  </steps>

