  <notes>Do NOT sort inside this component — the memos prop is already sorted by 033.

Completion notes (2026-07-03):
- Delivered MemoList.tsx (~150 lines total; ~110 non-comment LOC) using Fluent v9 Menu + MenuTrigger disableButtonEnhancement + TextBulletList24Regular icon
- Delivered MemoList.test.tsx with 10 tests, all passing (no @testing-library/react — used ReactDOM + act harness per useSprkMemoRepository.test.ts pattern)
- Full Notepad test suite: 81 passing (up from 71 pre-034 — includes 10 new MemoList tests, all prior tests still green)
- Zero hex/rgb; zero @spaarke/auth or BFF imports; zero touches to App.tsx/NotepadShell/package.json
- deriveTitle precedence verified in tests: sprk_name wins when non-empty and not "Untitled"; falls through to first non-empty body line otherwise
- Current memo highlight via tokens.colorNeutralBackground3 through mergeClasses conditional
- Empty-state MenuItem uses disabled prop so Fluent v9 blocks onClick natively
- Icon chosen: TextBulletList24Regular (spec called for "List24Regular" — Fluent v9 exports it as TextBulletList24Regular; List24Regular does not exist in the installed @fluentui/react-icons v2)
- LOC slightly above hint (~110 vs ≤80) — kept data-memoid/data-current attrs for testability without RTL + inlined formatCreatedOn helper</notes>

